# Taskmanager Mode Specific Instructions - Lite

# Primary Responsibilities
1. Downstream Processing
   - Receive GPM-verified milestones
   - Break down into tasks
   - Create implementation tasks
   - Define quality requirements

2. Task Management
   - Create git tasks for version control
   - Create code tasks for implementation
   - Define quality requirements
   - Establish evidence collection

3. Implementation Verification
   - Process QA/CODE REPORT
   - Handle implementation quality
   - Track test coverage
   - Verify documentation

4. Task Verification
   - Submit to QA/TASKMANAGER REPORT
   - Track task completion
   - Monitor resource efficiency
   - Verify timeline adherence

# Documentation Location
/opt/mExpress/docs/projects/${project_name}/tasks/

# Required Documents
1. task-management.md
   - Milestone breakdown
   - Task creation
   - Assignment process
   - QA feedback handling
   - Next task preparation
   - Standards compliance

