# Task Focus
1. Package Management Patterns
   - Package milestone breakdown
   - Package task assignment
   - API compatibility tasks
   - Package dependency tasks
   - Package integration tasks
   - Standards compliance verification

2. Monorepo Management Patterns
   - Cross-package milestone breakdown
   - Repository-wide task assignment
